ΔP benign  (control) : -2.1755   p = 0.990942
Interaction          : +18.4530   p = 0.000100
Share of the harmful shift also seen on benign prompts: -13.4%
Only the interaction is specific to refusal. The rest is what
moving from chat to agent does to EVERY prompt.

